---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Section from '../../components/ui/Section.astro';
import Button from '../../components/ui/Button.astro';
import ContextualVisual from '../../components/ui/ContextualVisual.astro';
import { getPropertyVisual } from '../../lib/contextual-images';

const visual = getPropertyVisual('BUSINESS_PARK');
const officialSource = 'https://eens.co.ke/property/warehouse-baba-dogo/warehouse-along-mombasa-road/eens-business-park/';
const referenceListing = 'https://finlay.co.ke/listings/eens-business-park-syokimau';
---

<Base
	title="Eens Business Park | Syokimau, Mombasa Road"
	description="Published context for Eens Business Park in Syokimau, with links to shop, warehouse, godown, and other property directories."
>
	<Section class="bg-background pt-10 md:pt-16">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
			<div class="max-w-3xl">
				<span class="font-mono text-[13px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.4px] text-primary">EENS BUSINESS PARK</span>
				<h1 class="mt-4 text-balance font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-1px] md:text-6xl md:tracking-[-1.8px]">Eens Business Park in Syokimau.</h1>
				<p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-pretty text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Eens Business Park is a commercial and industrial property location on Mombasa Road in Syokimau. Use the directories below to inspect verified space by type.</p>
				<div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
					<Button href="/contact" size="lg">Arrange a viewing</Button>
					<Button href="/shops" variant="secondary" size="lg">Browse shop units</Button>
				</div>
			</div>
			{visual && <div class="mt-12"><ContextualVisual visual={visual} priority /></div>}
			<p class="mt-3 font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground">Contextual photo. It does not depict a specific Eens unit.</p>
		</div>
	</Section>

	<Section class="bg-secondary">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
			<div class="max-w-3xl">
				<span class="font-mono text-[13px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.4px] text-primary">PUBLISHED PATHS</span>
				<h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.6px]">Choose the property type.</h2>
				<p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-muted-foreground">This is the Eens Business Park overview in Syokimau. The type directories remain the source of truth for published listings and their availability.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
				{[
					['Shop units', '/shops', 'Retail and commercial spaces'],
					['Warehouses', '/warehouses', 'Published industrial specifications'],
					['Godowns', '/godowns', 'Storage and distribution space'],
					['Apartments', '/apartments', 'Residential sale listings'],
				].map(([label, href, description]) => (
					<a href={href} class="rounded-xl border border-hairline-steel bg-background p-5 transition-[border-color,transform] duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-primary focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring/50">
						<h3 class="font-display text-xl font-medium">{label}</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">{description}</p>
						<span class="mt-5 inline-flex min-h-10 items-center text-sm font-medium text-primary">View directory <span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-1">→</span></span>
					</a>
				))}
			</div>
		</div>
	</Section>

	<Section class="bg-background">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
			<div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr]">
				<div>
					<span class="font-mono text-[13px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.4px] text-primary">REGISTER STATUS</span>
					<h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.6px]">Shop records are added progressively.</h2>
				</div>
				<div class="space-y-4 text-muted-foreground">
					<p>The planned register covers 45 physical shop units. Each unit enters Tina as unpublished and is added to the public directory only after its factual row has been reviewed.</p>
					<p>Syokimau is a location, not automatic proof of compound membership. Existing Syokimau properties stay separate until Eens confirms that they belong to this park.</p>
					<Button href="/contact" variant="secondary">Ask about the register</Button>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</Section>

	<Section class="bg-secondary">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
			<h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.4px]">Source notes</h2>
			<p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm text-muted-foreground">The overview uses public property descriptions for location and commercial context. Confirm current availability, exact unit membership, and viewing details against the published listing before acting.</p>
			<div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 font-mono text-xs">
				<a href={officialSource} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary underline-offset-2 hover:underline focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring/50">Eens source</a>
				<a href={referenceListing} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary underline-offset-2 hover:underline focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring/50">Reference listing</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</Section>
</Base>
